mapping "W0864.1" source="W0864" target="242413007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W0864 = Swedish extension of W08 SNOMED CT 242413007 (fall from other furniture) at
        (industrial/construction area) during (vital activity such as rest, sleep, meals, personal
        hygiene). Target SNOMED CT 433657 = (242413007), the standard concept that the Athena crosswalk
        assigns to the parent ICD-10 W08. The Swedish 4-6 char source adds place+activity axes for which
        no standard SNOMED CT concept exists: the [X] place-level codes (e.g. 40419731) (436583), and the
        activity axis has no SNOMED CT representation at all. 433657 fully subsumes every source in this
        range (every fall from furniture at a place during an activity is a fall from furniture), so the
        relationship is broader. Confidence (moderate): best available standard concept, parent
        crosswalk verified, but the source is an unspecified-extension code and the place+activity
        detail cannot be carried into the target.
        """
}
